   - Pass: At least one plausible failure scenario proposed with worked example.
   - Fail: No failure mode analysis, or trivial/inapplicable scenarios.

Final Verdict:
- Module passes if and only if all 9 criteria are passed.
- Any failure leads to a full module fail.

